The JellyfinDbContext is not directly visible here. The BackupService depends on IDbContextFactory<JellyfinDbContext> to create the DbContext. I can mock the factory and the DbContext to simulate the entityTypes property and the database calls.

I will write a test that mocks the dependencies of BackupService, including the logger, the DbContext factory, the DbContext, and the database provider. I will simulate the presence of one entity type with a name, and a zip archive with the expected entries to trigger the log call on line 211.

I will submit the test now.

